        <briefdescription>
<para>Parses <computeroutput>text</computeroutput> into a <ref refid="structjam_1_1Document" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/dev/jam/docs/tagfile.xml">jam::Document</ref> and an optional inline <ref refid="class_symbol_document" kindref="compound">SymbolDocument</ref>. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Built-in languages build both trees synchronously; library languages return a null <ref refid="class_symbol_document" kindref="compound">SymbolDocument</ref> and populate symbols asynchronously in <ref refid="class_built_in_language_1a1655e858f06b9f31966dd473b2cf4294" kindref="member">index()</ref>.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>text</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>UTF-8 source text to parse. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>path</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Canonical source file path. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>Pair of parsed document (or nullptr on failure) and optional symbol document. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
