        <name>getSymbol</name>
        <qualifiedname>MarkdownLanguage::getSymbol</qualifiedname>
        <reimplements refid="class_built_in_language_1a28bcb8d7e1d8d47ec696b7feab03c529">getSymbol</reimplements>
        <param>
          <type>const <ref refid="classjuce_1_1File" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/JUCE/docs/tagfile.xml">juce::File</ref> &amp;</type>
          <declname>file</declname>
        </param>
        <param>
          <type>std::string_view</type>
          <declname>name</declname>
        </param>
        <param>
          <type>int</type>
          <declname>role</declname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Computes the 64-bit symbol identifier for a Markdown token or link target. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Markdown links separate a target file and an anchor with the hash character. Reference tokens split <computeroutput>name</computeroutput> at that separator and pass the resolved file and anchor to <ref refid="class_built_in_language_1a554a0a4d4b5ab2d93603ddd8a43b2c61" kindref="member">getSymbolHash()</ref>. An empty target keeps <computeroutput>file</computeroutput>, and a non-empty target resolves from the parent directory of <computeroutput>file</computeroutput>. Non-reference tokens delegate to <ref refid="class_built_in_language_1a28bcb8d7e1d8d47ec696b7feab03c529" kindref="member">BuiltInLanguage::getSymbol()</ref>.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>file</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Markdown file that contains the token. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>name</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Token text or link destination. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>role</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Bitmask of <ref refid="structjam_1_1LanguageRole" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/dev/jam/docs/tagfile.xml">jam::LanguageRole</ref> flags for the token slot. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>64-bit symbol identifier for the token or link target. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
